  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Sky Geeks&#x2019; mission is to foster sustainable and inclusive tech-enabled economic development in Palestine. By delivering an integrated approach of training individuals in specialist tech skills at scale alongside developing the capacity of tech-services companies and increasing access to markets, Gaza Sky Geeks aims to grow the competitiveness of the Palestinian tech sector in the global market.</narrative>
  </description>
